  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is NOT therefore a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The proposed change of use of 12 Holyrood Avenue, Harrow,\r\nHA2 8TP from a C3 dwellinghouse to a C4 House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) is\r\nsubject to Harrow’s borough wide Article 4 Direction relating to HMOs. The\r\nArticle 4 Direction removes permitted development rights otherwise granted\r\nunder Class L of Part 3 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General\r\nPermitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) for changes of use\r\nfrom C3 to C4. As such, the proposal does not constitute permitted development\r\nand requires full planning permission."
